* 05 red LED + series resistor (150 ohm) I-V sweep.
* Analysis : DC sweep of the source 0..5 V in 25 mV steps (201 rows).
* Outputs  : 05-led-iv.csv = v_src_V, v_led_V, i_A.
* NODE circuit: Vsrc -> R 150 -> LED anode; LED cathode = gnd. (about 20 mA at 5 V.)
* Parameters: red LED N 2.0 Is 1.19e-17 Rs 9.9, CJO=0 TT=0, R 150.
.include common.inc
Vs in 0 0
R1 in a 150
D1 a 0 DLEDRED
.control
dc Vs 0 5 0.025
let i_led = -i(Vs)
set wr_singlescale
set numdgt=8
wrdata build/05.dat v(a) i_led
.endc
.end
